WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.810
Hello, Ms. Weaver.

2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:08.810
Anna, I have good news and I have bad news. Which do you want to hear first?

3
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.130
The good news. No … okay, the bad news.

4
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.950
The bad news is you are not good at reading the news.

5
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.250
Oh. I am very sorry to hear that.

6
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.870
So, starting next month you will not read the news.

7
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.730
Next month is July. You are firing me in July.

8
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:41.070
No. I am not firing you in July … or in August or in September. That is the good news.

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.250
Okay. You are not firing me. I am not reading the news.

10
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.350
What will I be doing?

11
00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.870
Well, you are good at asking questions.

12
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.510
You are good at talking to people.

13
00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.190
You are good at showing your feelings.

14
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.350
And you are great at being silly.

15
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.890
Thank you, Ms. Weaver. But what does all that mean?

16
00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:20.790
I have a new assignment for you! Your skills are perfect for a new show … a children’s show.

17
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:30.610
A children’s show ... That is awesome! When do I start?

18
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.910
You start next month. Start thinking of ideas for the show.

19
00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:20.310
I have tons of ideas! I can show children what it’s like in outer space ...

20
00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.930
… or in the deep, dark ocean …

21
00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:29.510
Those are great ideas, Anna. Please go think of more … at your desk.

22
00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.390
Yes. What other things can I show them? Mt. Everest!

23
00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.630
Everyone has different skills.

24
00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.050
You have skills.

25
00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.190
I have skills.

26
00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:50.790
The important thing is to know what you are good at.

27
00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:52.290
Until next time!
